      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Giant coronary aneurysms are sometimes misdiagnosed as cardiac tumors when they are filled with thrombus. In this case, dynamic magnetic resonance imaging revealed the coronary artery and cardiac mass, and was the most useful tool for diagnosis of giant coronary aneurysms non-invasively."},
